{"id":"n41177-1-7","stage":4,"title":"냉기 · 寒气","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n41177-1-7-1","ko":"방바닥이 너무 차가워서 냉기가 올라오네.","zh":"地板太冷了，寒气都往上冒呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"방바닥이","meaning":"地板","explanation":"방바닥：地板；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"방바닥","audio":"/audio/166caf189f27d0081828.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15481","senseId":"1","lemma":"방바닥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"차가워서","meaning":"凉，冰凉","explanation":"차갑다：凉，冰凉；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"차갑다","audio":"/audio/489db26a6bdebee8cbe3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71730","senseId":"1","lemma":"차갑다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"냉기가","meaning":"寒气，凉气","explanation":"냉기：寒气，凉气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"냉기","audio":"/audio/cc703217a2ec235b27ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"41177","senseId":"1","lemma":"냉기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"올라오네.","meaning":"上来，升至","explanation":"올라오다：上来，升至；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"올라오다","audio":"/audio/3a939ba13b7d1af7902f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67841","senseId":"6","lemma":"올라오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"166caf189f27d008","term":"방바닥","zh":"地板","audio":"/audio/166caf189f27d0081828.mp3","entryId":"15481","definition":"房间的地面。","pronunciation":["방빠닥"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"489db26a6bdebee8","term":"차갑다","zh":"凉，冰凉","audio":"/audio/489db26a6bdebee8cbe3.mp3","entryId":"71730","definition":"皮肤接触到的感觉很凉。","pronunciation":["차갑따"]},{"id":"cc703217a2ec235b","term":"냉기","zh":"寒气，凉气","audio":"/audio/cc703217a2ec235b27ab.mp3","entryId":"41177","definition":"冷空气或冰凉的气息。","pronunciation":["냉ː기"]},{"id":"3a939ba13b7d1af7","term":"올라오다","zh":"上来，升至","audio":"/audio/3a939ba13b7d1af7902f.mp3","entryId":"67841","definition":"由下往上走。","pronunciation":["올라오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/113647138ac12c7ed1ab.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n41177-1-7-2","ko":"보일러를 틀어야겠군.","zh":"得把锅炉打开才行。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"보일러를","meaning":"锅炉，家用锅炉","explanation":"보일러：锅炉，家用锅炉；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"보일러","audio":"/audio/cd68eee0e0a4a25fc150.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59573","senseId":"1","lemma":"보일러","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"틀어야겠군.","meaning":"打开，开","explanation":"틀다：打开，开；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；군：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"틀다","audio":"/audio/2d0358325f7b60f9b306.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89816","senseId":"4","lemma":"틀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"cd68eee0e0a4a25f","term":"보일러","zh":"锅炉，家用锅炉","audio":"/audio/cd68eee0e0a4a25fc150.mp3","entryId":"59573","definition":"利用烧水时产生的蒸汽或热水来使房间变暖或提供热水的装置。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"2d0358325f7b60f9","term":"틀다","zh":"打开，开","audio":"/audio/2d0358325f7b60f9b306.mp3","entryId":"89816","definition":"启动机械或装置。","pronunciation":["틀다"]}],"audio":"/audio/083dccca4bead1f8f1c3.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.126,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=41177","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":148,"sequenceScore":2.9527,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["得把锅炉打开才行。","地板太冷了，寒气都往上冒呢。","你也在看那部剧啊？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["地板太冷了，寒气都往上冒呢。","你也在看那部剧啊？","得把锅炉打开才行。"],"answer":2}]}
